# A required field of a struct the lens writes, never written beneath it.
-- source.cue --
a: string
-- target.cue --
o: {init: string, more: int}
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {o: {init: input.a}}
-- out --
not total
result.o.more is required by the target schema and never written (rule required-not-written) @ lens.cue:2:10
